{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 180,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's what happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you put your DNA under a microscope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3360,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can extract some from your mouth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5280,
    "dDurationMs": 2723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just gargle salt water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8003,
    "dDurationMs": 2484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and mix this with soap and rubbing alcohol."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10487,
    "dDurationMs": 2263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll get a gooey mass at the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12750,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14190,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of it is yours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15480,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but some of it actually\ncomes from bacteria"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17850,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "living in your mouth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19100,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At 100 times magnification,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20970,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll see these strings,\nwhich are coiled up DNA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24240,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "proteins and debris,  all clumped together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27540,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But looking at them is\npretty much useless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30960,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, even with a million\ndollar electron microscope,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34080,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't actually see the\ngenetic code that makes you you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37949,
    "dDurationMs": 3331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how do you read DNA?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41280,
    "dDurationMs": 551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41831,
    "dDurationMs": 787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DNA evidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42618,
    "dDurationMs": 796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43414,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your family secrets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45544,
    "dDurationMs": 1886,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are not the father."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47430,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Diseases you haven't\nbeen diagnosed with yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49560,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Predicting or even diagnosing cancers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52110,
    "dDurationMs": 3477,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tiny quirks of what makes you you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56087,
    "dDurationMs": 2773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for the vast majority\nof human history,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58860,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have not been able to read it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60960,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is completely illegible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63870,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of this might still\nbe impossible today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66270,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if not for one man who took a lot of drugs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69750,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stumbled upon a discovery\nthat unlocked DNA forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74550,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also, he was kind of a jerk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79800,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 1960s as a biochemistry\nstudent at Berkeley,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83640,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kary Mullis wasn't interested\nin going to his classes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87180,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was too busy taking LSD and lots of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91680,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis didn't take\nuniversity very seriously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94470,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His PhD dissertation was filled with jokes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97380,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the committee refused to approve it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99450,
    "dDurationMs": 3513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until he, quote, cut\nall the wacko stuff out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103800,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But LSD fueled his eccentric genius,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106890,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sparking all sorts of interesting ideas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109650,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It did trickle into his science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111318,
    "dDurationMs": 3552,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for example, he wrote a\nletter to the journal Nature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114870,
    "dDurationMs": 2065,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which chronicled the, quote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116935,
    "dDurationMs": 3845,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "entire universe from the\nbeginning to the end,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120780,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they published it, which is amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123780,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was like 22 years\nold, they published that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126660,
    "dDurationMs": 1165,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After graduating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127825,
    "dDurationMs": 2555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis just bummed around for a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, he gets a job in a cardiology lab,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133200,
    "dDurationMs": 1692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he's just kind of so horrified"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134892,
    "dDurationMs": 2478,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at how many rats are being killed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137370,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he starts writing fiction,\nhe gets a job in a bakery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142050,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One day he's working in this bakery,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143880,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this guy, Tom White, walks in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147150,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it turns out Tom White\nworks at this company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150570,
    "dDurationMs": 2856,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a biotech startup called Cetus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153426,
    "dDurationMs": 1674,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They sort of get to talking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155100,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this guy offers Kary\nMullis, he offers him a job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158812,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "White recommended Mullis to his higher-ups, saying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161746,
    "dDurationMs": 1274,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " \n\"Hire this guy Mullis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163020,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's an excellent synthetic chemist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165240,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I knew he was a good chemist because he'd been synthesizing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167910,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hallucinogenic drugs at Berkeley.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171750,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cetus was one of the first\nbiotech companies in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175050,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was founded in 1971."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177240,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An exciting time when scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178920,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were starting to figure\nout how to manipulate DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182460,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the most important\ndiscoveries was actually made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184890,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that year while researchers\nat Johns Hopkins"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187200,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were studying the bacteriophage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192210,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The phage is a virus that hijacks bacteria"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195030,
    "dDurationMs": 3077,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by injecting its DNA into the cell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198107,
    "dDurationMs": 5086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bacteria is then\nforced to create copies of the phage until it explodes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204870,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the researchers realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206100,
    "dDurationMs": 2495,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that some bacteria evolved defenses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208595,
    "dDurationMs": 2665,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that make them more\nresistant to the virus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211260,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their defensive molecules\nwould scan the phage DNA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214080,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "looking for a specific sequence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216510,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when they found a match,\nthey would cut the DNA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219180,
    "dDurationMs": 2727,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "turning it into useless strings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221907,
    "dDurationMs": 4605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientists called these\nlittle scissor molecules restriction enzymes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226512,
    "dDurationMs": 4458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and different types of restriction enzymes cut\nDNA at different places"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230970,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they work on human DNA too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234570,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the researchers extracted the enzymes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236670,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to essentially create a\ntoolbox of nanoscopic scissors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240210,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would allow them to cut DNA at will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244290,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cetus was trying to use biotech like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246720,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to develop commercial DNA\ntests that hospitals could use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250260,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to quickly diagnose diseases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252210,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the time, simple DNA\ntests like this were impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256251,
    "dDurationMs": 3369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say you want to detect\nsickle cell disease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259620,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you could just\nlook at the blood cells"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261870,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under a microscope, but Cetus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264180,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wanted to prove that they could\ndo it with a genetic test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267390,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for one of those, you would start off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269190,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a sample of DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273780,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In each of your cells,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275010,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are 23 pairs of chromosomes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278100,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you zoom into the\ntip of the 11th chromosome,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281490,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll find the beta globin gene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283920,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sequence of adenine,\nthymine, guanine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286530,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and cytosine nucleotides\ncontrols the shape"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289530,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your red blood cells."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291060,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you inherit a\nT instead of an A here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293670,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from both of your parents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295110,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, you're born with sickle cell anemia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297600,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, you can't see any of\nthis under a microscope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300540,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how do you check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301590,
    "dDurationMs": 2605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these single letter mutations against DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304195,
    "dDurationMs": 2648,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's over six billion letters long?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308129,
    "dDurationMs": 3668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis said that this was the equivalent to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311797,
    "dDurationMs": 5021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reading a license plate on interstate five"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316818,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the dark"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318448,
    "dDurationMs": 1815,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the Moon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320263,
    "dDurationMs": 2477,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But luckily there was a way to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322740,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first step is to\nseparate the beta globin gene"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325710,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the rest of the DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328170,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can use restriction\nenzymes on your sample"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330870,
    "dDurationMs": 3993,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to cut the DNA into little\npieces, all of different lengths,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335554,
    "dDurationMs": 1314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the sickle cell mutation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337202,
    "dDurationMs": 2218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be on one of these ribbons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339420,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how does that help?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341370,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, DNA is negatively charged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343350,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if you place your cut up\nsample into a porous material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346950,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a gel and apply a voltage across it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349413,
    "dDurationMs": 2517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the DNA pieces will flow\nfrom the negative end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351930,
    "dDurationMs": 1312,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the positive end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353910,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because they're all different lengths,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356010,
    "dDurationMs": 2936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shorter pieces of DNA will\nnavigate the gel pores quicker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358946,
    "dDurationMs": 1686,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than longer ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360632,
    "dDurationMs": 2638,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is called gel electrophoresis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363270,
    "dDurationMs": 2913,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it lets you separate\nDNA out by length."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367350,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its results are consistent enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369030,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that after the DNA is spread\nacross the gel, you can see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372000,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where different length strands end up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374640,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Near the start, you'll see DNA strands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376440,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are 10,000 base pairs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378480,
    "dDurationMs": 3993,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "followed by shorter ones,\n3000, 1000, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383238,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because you used specific\nrestriction enzymes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386305,
    "dDurationMs": 2105,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can predict that\nthe sickle cell mutation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388410,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was sliced into a 2000 base pair segment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391110,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393390,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now that we know\nwhere the target DNA is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395580,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can move on to step two,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397200,
    "dDurationMs": 1277,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "checking whether our sample"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398477,
    "dDurationMs": 2663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually has that mutation or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401738,
    "dDurationMs": 2602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you soak the sample\nin an alkaline solution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404340,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or heat it up to over 90\ndegrees, the hydrogen bonds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407670,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between nucleotides will\nbreak and the DNA will unzip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411810,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the two strands will be\nable to pair to any other DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415170,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as long as it's a match."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417030,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As only pair to Ts and Gs only pair to Cs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420150,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need a complimentary sequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientists could take advantage of this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425160,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by synthesizing short\npieces of DNA in a lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428370,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are called probes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430050,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can be designed to\nhave any specific sequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434430,
    "dDurationMs": 4353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if the sickle cell mutation is CTGTG,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438783,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can create a probe that\nhas the complimentary sequence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441870,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GACAC, that will stick to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445170,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because normal DNA\nis supposed to be CTGAG,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448950,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your custom probe won't be a good match."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453510,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the trick is to make these\nsynthetic probes radioactive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457350,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and add them in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458940,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So after a while, your\nprobes will either pair"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461490,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the DNA or just keep floating around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464100,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you wash your sample,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465780,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any probes that didn't\npair will rinse off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469650,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the final step is to check\nthe sample for radioactivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473430,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that with sickle cell blood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475290,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a radioactive signal on the right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477660,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The probe found the\nmutation and stuck to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480600,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the case of normal\nblood, there's no signal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483210,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of the probes paired,\nso there must be no mutation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486300,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is also this other\nhuge signal in both cases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489960,
    "dDurationMs": 3355,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because the probes\nwill match to other parts of the DNA too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493315,
    "dDurationMs": 2495,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not just\nto the sickle cell region."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495810,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why you need to\nseparate the mutation out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498180,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using the gel first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500820,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This technique was known\nas the Southern Blot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503490,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it worked, but there was a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506310,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took days or even weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508560,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every step of it is difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510270,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every step of it, it's\nlike super inefficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513750,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The matching is inefficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515220,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The radio-sensitive paper\nis really inefficient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518260,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you have these technicians"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519760,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having to work with radioactive stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521970,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it happened in a\nway that it was so slow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524130,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and cumbersome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524963,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it wasn't commercially\nfeasible in any way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529500,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cetus wanted a DNA test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531090,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could be done in a\nday in a single test tube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533970,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were close."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535500,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They developed a method that could test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537330,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for sickle cell disease\nin just seven hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540210,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this new test suffered\nfrom a different problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543090,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The signal was just too faint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545550,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could hardly tell whether the sample"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547500,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had the sickle cell mutation or not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549330,
    "dDurationMs": 3287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it would barely\nreturn any results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552617,
    "dDurationMs": 2053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Kary Mullis didn't work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554670,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on these cutting edge DNA tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556800,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His job was to make those\nshort radioactive bits of DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560160,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would be used as probes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562710,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wasn't even doing the interesting part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564270,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he's just making these snippets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566040,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's his job, and it is a slow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570240,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "repetitive, extremely boring job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573390,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So while he's working there, maybe in part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576060,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because he is bored, he's just obnoxious,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579450,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's like a really annoying person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582120,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He doesn't get along with anybody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583440,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He picks fights with like receptionists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585540,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and security guards and his colleagues."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587610,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He also was a womanizer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589230,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he would be hitting\non people all the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591480,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was at the same\ntime he was also married."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593820,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was one time where he threatened"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595380,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bring a gun to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597090,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really like not someone\nyou would wanna work with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600870,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, one day they bring in this new machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604680,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the workplace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606240,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This machine basically could synthesize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609030,
    "dDurationMs": 3127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these snippets all by itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612157,
    "dDurationMs": 4163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's basically doing, you\nknow, a month of his work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616320,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in like a day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618240,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis, he's like, now\nI both have free time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621030,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I have a lot of\nthese little DNA snippets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623430,
    "dDurationMs": 1995,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can sort of play with and figure out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625425,
    "dDurationMs": 1648,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, what can I do with them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627073,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now he doesn't really\nhave a lot of work to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629490,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And also people don't like him at work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631983,
    "dDurationMs": 3447,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he basically starts taking weekends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635430,
    "dDurationMs": 3243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Mendocino County to just relax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640290,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As he was driving up to his cabin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642240,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a Friday night in the spring of 1983,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645090,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis let his mind wander."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647520,
    "dDurationMs": 2395,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He thought about that new DNA test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649915,
    "dDurationMs": 3215,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and was trying to think\nof a way to fix it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653130,
    "dDurationMs": 2111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then a thought struck him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655241,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if instead of inventing a more powerful telescope"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658920,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to read a single license\nplate from the Moon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661560,
    "dDurationMs": 4096,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he just created more of\nthat same license plate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665656,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His mind raced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668779,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis\ncould see DNA chains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670990,
    "dDurationMs": 2517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "floating all around him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673507,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Blue and pink images"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675240,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of electric molecules injected themselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677490,
    "dDurationMs": 2007,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between the mountain and my eyes.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680610,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wasn't on LSD,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682560,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but his mind by then had\nlearned how to get there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686580,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could sit on a DNA molecule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688560,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching the reactions unwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692477,
    "dDurationMs": 2383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, the whole DNA sequence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694860,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the sickle cell mutation was known."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697290,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because Mullis knew one\nstrand, by complementarity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701070,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he knew the other as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703080,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if he heated up the DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704850,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and separated the strands, he\ncould design short bits of DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708510,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would pair to both strands\nanywhere on the sequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712050,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These would be his primers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714150,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, Mullis could use something\ncalled DNA polymerase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717780,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a special protein\nthat attaches itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720000,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to sites like these\nwhere primers are paired"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722730,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the original DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724530,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The polymerase basically grabs nucleotides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726930,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "floating around and extends the primer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729750,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the primer is built as\na perfect complimentary pair"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732390,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the strand of DNA it's attached to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735277,
    "dDurationMs": 2003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This creates an identical copy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737280,
    "dDurationMs": 2396,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the initial double helix."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739676,
    "dDurationMs": 4774,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Polymerase exists in every\ncell of every living thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744450,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is what's responsible\nfor replicating DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747190,
    "dDurationMs": 1033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "during cell division."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748223,
    "dDurationMs": 4084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it will only ever build out a primer in one direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752307,
    "dDurationMs": 2956,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of like a one-way street."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755263,
    "dDurationMs": 4157,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see each DNA strand starts\nwith a phosphate molecule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759420,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is called the five prime end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762154,
    "dDurationMs": 1355,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That phosphate is attached"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763509,
    "dDurationMs": 2811,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a sugar molecule called deoxyribose,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766320,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which holds one of the four nucleotides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768837,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And deoxyribose also connects\nto the next phosphate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772170,
    "dDurationMs": 1893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so this pattern repeats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775155,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the last deoxyribose molecule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777394,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't have another\nphosphate connected to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779688,
    "dDurationMs": 3132,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it ends with an OH group instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782820,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the three prime\nend, our street exit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786240,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The three prime end on one\nDNA strand is always connected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789390,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the five prime end on the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793080,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second DNA strand\nalways points the other way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797460,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And DNA polymerase needs an OH group"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799770,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to attach the next nucleotide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801900,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it always builds on\nthe three prime end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805939,
    "dDurationMs": 3371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that wasn't a limitation,\nit was an advantage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809310,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Mullis knew exactly how to use it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812100,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could create two primers\nthat would bind to the DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814770,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before the sickle cell mutation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816900,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each on a different strand\npointing at each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820710,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if he added polymerase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821970,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along with some spare nucleotides,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823830,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would have to extend both primers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825690,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "toward and over the sickle cell mutation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828990,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This would create two\nseparate DNA segments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831600,
    "dDurationMs": 1383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both with the mutation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834060,
    "dDurationMs": 3872,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few miles down the road,\nhe had another eureka."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837932,
    "dDurationMs": 3947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could just do these three\nsteps again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841879,
    "dDurationMs": 1511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unzip the DNA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843390,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pair the primers, and use\npolymerase to extend them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847770,
    "dDurationMs": 3198,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He now had four DNA\nsequences with the mutation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850968,
    "dDurationMs": 2562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he could make that eight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853530,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then 16, 32, 64."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857190,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he realized that if he\nrepeated this chain reaction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859590,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "30 times, he would have\nover a billion copies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of that specific DNA segment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865200,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all with the sickle cell mutation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867720,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could cover the entire Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869580,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with identical copies\nof the license plate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873509,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if he designed different primers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875970,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he could change the length"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877110,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the DNA section that\nwould get replicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879870,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This didn't only work for\nthe sickle cell mutation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882990,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As long as you knew the\nsequence for any part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885510,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of any DNA, human, plant, bacterial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888480,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could make copies\nof that exact segment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891030,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the copies would grow exponentially,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893370,
    "dDurationMs": 2775,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a nuclear chain reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896145,
    "dDurationMs": 2205,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898350,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis had invented a DNA photocopier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901920,
    "dDurationMs": 4983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He named it the polymerase chain\nreaction, or PCR for short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908040,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immediately he stopped the car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909810,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and scribbled his idea on\nthe back of a gas receipt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912630,
    "dDurationMs": 3457,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PCR consumed his thoughts\nfor the rest of the weekend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916087,
    "dDurationMs": 1703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"It was difficult for me to sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917790,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with DNA bombs exploding in my brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921540,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if I had not taken LSD ever?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923717,
    "dDurationMs": 2443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would I have invented PCR?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926160,
    "dDurationMs": 3297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know. I doubt it.\nI seriously doubt it.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929457,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monday morning, he bursts\ninto the office at Cetus Corp,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933030,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he pitches his idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934080,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's like, basically,\nlook, hey, I came up with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936890,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a DNA Xerox machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939331,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, we are working so hard to read this tiny tiny thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943290,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if we made a billion copies of it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946020,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would be so much easier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948660,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis presented his idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950010,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a company-wide seminar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951600,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but people started leaving\nbefore he was done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955680,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of them are skeptical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957480,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They've heard him pitch\ncockamamie ideas before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961260,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other thing is that they\nwere like, that's so simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963930,
    "dDurationMs": 3787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had to have been tried before\nand it can't possibly work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967717,
    "dDurationMs": 1351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, there must be a reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969068,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why this is not the way we're doing this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972030,
    "dDurationMs": 2758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Mullis was undeterred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974788,
    "dDurationMs": 3392,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He started his first\nexperiment in September, 1983,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978180,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trying to replicate a 400 base\npair fragment of human DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982680,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After months of trying, he\ncouldn't get PCR to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986113,
    "dDurationMs": 2807,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Human DNA was just too complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988920,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he set his sights on a smaller fragment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991260,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of bacterial DNA, just 25 base pairs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995430,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For months, he'd separate the\nstrands, attach the primers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998970,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "add the polymerase, hoping\nto amplify that small section"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002390,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of bacterial DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004970,
    "dDurationMs": 1517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the summer of 1984,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006487,
    "dDurationMs": 4748,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis thought he had it — indisputable\nproof that PCR worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011235,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But others at Cetus weren't convinced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014903,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His work was sloppy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016670,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't have any controls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018050,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or do repetitions of his experiments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020691,
    "dDurationMs": 1463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tom White and Norman Arnheim,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022154,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another colleague at\nCetus said that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023914,
    "dDurationMs": 1992,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"No one but Kary believed the data he showed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025906,
    "dDurationMs": 1804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "demonstrated what he said it did.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027710,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Any independent scientist\nlooking at the data today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030260,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would come to the same conclusion.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033227,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis took these comments personally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035930,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He constantly argued with his colleagues"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037760,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about these results and\neven started a fist fight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040340,
    "dDurationMs": 1246,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at one point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041586,
    "dDurationMs": 3827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was\nlosing credibility fast and everyone wanted him out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046208,
    "dDurationMs": 2892,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But White argued that PCR had potential,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049100,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Mullis was given a one\nyear probationary period"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052250,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to prove that PCR could work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054560,
    "dDurationMs": 2313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he wouldn't be doing it alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058340,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "White, Arnheim"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059360,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Henry Ehrlich\nassigned other technicians"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061730,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to develop PCR along with Mullis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063860,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And from there on out,\nthis group of scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066350,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worked overtime to make PCR a reality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069950,
    "dDurationMs": 4251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by spring 1985, after\nmonths of painstaking trial and error,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074201,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the group finally cracked it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079610,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had definitive proof\nthat PCR was possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083660,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With it, their new sickle\ncell diagnostic method"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086390,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worked like a charm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087470,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and could be done in under 10 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091700,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But PCR was still just a concept"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094370,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a huge problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096890,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For each cycle, you needed\nto raise the temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099290,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 95 degrees Celsius to unzip the DNA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then lower it to around 30\ndegrees to allow the primers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106400,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pair and the polymerase to extend them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109430,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you would repeat that cycle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110870,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heating back up to 95 degrees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113330,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem was that the polymerase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115280,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would get destroyed when it was heated up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117590,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was extracted from E. coli bacteria"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120290,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and E. coli can only survive up to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122273,
    "dDurationMs": 2618,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around 50 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124891,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you would have to stand there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126560,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and manually add in more polymerase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129470,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every time you cycled the temperature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131630,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that was expensive and time consuming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135740,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to do this\nloop like maybe 30 times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138770,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a piece of DNA you're looking at,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140600,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every time you gotta stop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142790,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you gotta add more polymerase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145160,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was just getting in\nthe way of the vision"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147590,
    "dDurationMs": 2311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and of the efficacy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149901,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was like, yeah, it\nwas adding more time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152000,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was adding more\ndifficulty to the process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155584,
    "dDurationMs": 2386,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, it turns out a solution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157970,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had been bubbling away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158900,
    "dDurationMs": 3155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the background for over 20 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163460,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1964,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164630,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a microbiologist named Tom Brock"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166610,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was visiting Yellowstone National Park."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168890,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He'd never been before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170450,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when he got to the\nboiling hot springs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173300,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "immediately the vivid hues of the yellow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175580,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and orange water caught his\neye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178458,
    "dDurationMs": 2075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are these colors bacteria?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181778,
    "dDurationMs": 2922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody thought that something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184700,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could live at higher\nthan 60 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189530,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this professor Thomas\nBrock, this microbiologist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192530,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he was like, no, no, no, no, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193940,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think not only can things\nlive at that temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196790,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think things can live\nabove 100 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199550,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think things can live in boiling water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202880,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brock set up a lab next\nto one of the springs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205250,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and asked his undergraduate student,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207140,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hudson Freeze, to tag along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210860,
    "dDurationMs": 4368,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I wasn't even old enough to drink."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215228,
    "dDurationMs": 2532,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, we would go to the spring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217760,
    "dDurationMs": 1975,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and collect the samples there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219735,
    "dDurationMs": 2693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then bring them back to the\nlaboratory for the analysis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222428,
    "dDurationMs": 2038,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So every day, oh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224466,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over about three or four days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226267,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would go in\nand I would pick up this tube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228651,
    "dDurationMs": 2074,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, a standard looking test tube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230725,
    "dDurationMs": 3293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I would go like that, and I'd flick it just to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234018,
    "dDurationMs": 2405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if there was anything growing in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237542,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didn't see anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238962,
    "dDurationMs": 1838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, this is never gonna work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240800,
    "dDurationMs": 4069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Third day, nothing, fourth\nday, ooh, look at this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244869,
    "dDurationMs": 1264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a little something on the bottom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246133,
    "dDurationMs": 2494,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I picked up the tube and shook it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248627,
    "dDurationMs": 1952,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this time there was this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250579,
    "dDurationMs": 2546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this stuff that was going (whistles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253125,
    "dDurationMs": 1463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255206,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I, well, that's interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258314,
    "dDurationMs": 3798,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I got a little pipette\nout, took a little drop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262112,
    "dDurationMs": 2787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "put it under a microscope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265418,
    "dDurationMs": 2874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I still get goosebumps,\nman, I'll tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268292,
    "dDurationMs": 1602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I still get goosebumps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272312,
    "dDurationMs": 2718,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I looked at it, and\nhere are all these worms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1275030,
    "dDurationMs": 1503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just crawling around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278420,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought, my god, I'm the\nfirst person to the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283250,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that ever sees this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285530,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was a graduate student in the lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288020,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so this graduate student said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290630,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, I think we ought to call\nit 'Hudsoniae Freeziensis'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294830,
    "dDurationMs": 2314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you do have a great name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297931,
    "dDurationMs": 4069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Tom said, no, no, you can't name it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302000,
    "dDurationMs": 4083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after a person, we're gonna\ncall it Thermus Aquaticus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306590,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the graduate student and I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308000,
    "dDurationMs": 2421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both looked at each other - hot water?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310421,
    "dDurationMs": 2499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man, that's not very creative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312920,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it meant that if an organism\nwas gonna live out there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1315920,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it had to have all of its\nessential enzymes adapted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320090,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "living at that temperature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322100,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was clear, boiling water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324140,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not going to knock these guys off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327382,
    "dDurationMs": 3748,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we thought it had no applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331130,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brock and Hudson published their findings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1332990,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stored a culture of Taq"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335725,
    "dDurationMs": 1405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the American Type Culture Collection,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337130,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a database that preserves\nmicrobial samples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343040,
    "dDurationMs": 2427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "16 years later, in the spring of 1985,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345467,
    "dDurationMs": 2656,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kary Mullis stumbled upon their discovery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350507,
    "dDurationMs": 1945,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was looking for a polymerase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352452,
    "dDurationMs": 3428,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could survive the\nhigh heat of the PCR cycle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355880,
    "dDurationMs": 1803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he had found it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358550,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At his suggestion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359750,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the group isolated the\npolymerase out of Taq"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362300,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and tried it in a PCR test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364280,
    "dDurationMs": 1863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The results were breathtaking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366980,
    "dDurationMs": 2072,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "David Gelfand, the Cetus scientist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369052,
    "dDurationMs": 2026,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who purified the new polymerase said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371078,
    "dDurationMs": 1547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"It worked like a charm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372625,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It worked better than anything\nwe have ever fantasized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375795,
    "dDurationMs": 2277,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The holy grail had been achieved.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379730,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only was Taq able to\nsurvive the high temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382550,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of PCR, it thrived in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385010,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the results with\nthe old E. coli polymerase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388550,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that it amplified\nthe sickle cell DNA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390920,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it amplified a lot of\nthe background DNA too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393980,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was messy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396080,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because primers\ncan actually attach to DNA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398420,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if they aren't a perfect match,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1401030,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they just need a low enough temperature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403100,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "otherwise the high kinetic\nenergy peels them off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405983,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with Taq, you never had\nto lower the temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408813,
    "dDurationMs": 1537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "below 50 degrees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410350,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the primers would\nvirtually only ever bind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413150,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to their target region."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415190,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These were the results with Taq."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418040,
    "dDurationMs": 3865,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It completely erased all\nof the background noise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421905,
    "dDurationMs": 1925,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could sort of set it and forget it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423830,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and come back, you know, 30 cycles later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426950,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a couple hours later"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428660,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all of a sudden you have a billion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431180,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the thing you're looking for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433580,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PCR worked and it worked effortlessly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435980,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could amplify any\npiece of DNA they wanted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438140,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no matter how small the sample."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440930,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cetus realized they had a golden goose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443720,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But other companies like Perkin Elmer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445700,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Kodak were starting\nto catch onto their idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449210,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if anyone else even briefly mentioned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451100,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the concept of PCR in their paper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453140,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cetus would lose all rights to the patent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456080,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they had to go public and\nthey had to do it quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459500,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The PCR group urged Mullis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461090,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to publish a solo paper\nfirst, since PCR was his idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464540,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Mullis procrastinated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466730,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Afraid they would lose credit for PCR,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468440,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rest of the group was forced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469910,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to publish an article on\ntheir own PCR research."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473990,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the first paper on PCR"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475400,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that came out in Science\nMagazine in December of 1985"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1478760,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "listed Mullis as the fourth author."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483770,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was furious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485420,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the time he got his own paper ready,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487580,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no reputable journal wanted it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1490250,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He remarked, \"Nature didn't call me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492710,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wasn't one of the good old boys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494420,
    "dDurationMs": 1797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Science rejected it too.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496217,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He claimed the PCR group stole his work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499107,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"My God, they're going to get\naway with their little trick.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1503810,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the group scrambled together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504980,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get Mullis the proper recognition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507830,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He became the face of PCR"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1509210,
    "dDurationMs": 3693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after giving a talk at a\nmicrobiology symposium in 1986."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1513777,
    "dDurationMs": 1873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, it was too late."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515650,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shortly after, still fueled\nby his anger for the group,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1518930,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis left Cetus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520850,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, the work on PCR\ncontinued without him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524000,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after he leaves,\nthey come up with like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526310,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "basically there are new PCR machines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1529370,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that do the whole thing for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532280,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And basically these machines are now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533780,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in like every lab that\ndoes any kind of work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538010,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with DNA anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540980,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PCR was a huge success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545822,
    "dDurationMs": 2148,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Polymerase chain reaction test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547970,
    "dDurationMs": 1651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PCR, PCR."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549621,
    "dDurationMs": 1254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a DNA photocopier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550875,
    "dDurationMs": 1738,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Measure remaining blood cancer cells"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552613,
    "dDurationMs": 1777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that other tests can't detect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554390,
    "dDurationMs": 1613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone was using it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556003,
    "dDurationMs": 5047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From DNA cloning and vaccines to detecting cancer and HIV,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561050,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PCR was saving lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563420,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It completely opened up everything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565790,
    "dDurationMs": 1491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it revolutionized everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567281,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "P-P-P-PCR."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1570680,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PCR could amplify the\ntiniest sample of DNA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574100,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It supercharged forensics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576260,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas man should be freed from prison"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578780,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because new DNA evidence does\nnot link him to the crime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582770,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hundreds of wrongfully convicted people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584720,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were freed and thousands\nof criminals were caught."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588770,
    "dDurationMs": 3243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Families separated by\nwar could be reunited."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1593750,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We use PCR all the time, all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598790,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everybody in our institute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603170,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scientists even tried"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604400,
    "dDurationMs": 4653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to use PCR on ancient DNA from\ninsects fossilized in amber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611860,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sound familiar?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614753,
    "dDurationMs": 4707,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like it's completely taken\nover so much of our world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619460,
    "dDurationMs": 1895,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And right at the center of this takeover,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621355,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kary Mullis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629000,
    "dDurationMs": 3234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Kary Mullis, a surfer,\na scientist who proved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632234,
    "dDurationMs": 1535,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that science can be fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633769,
    "dDurationMs": 3691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The world renowned inventor\nof polymerase chain reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637460,
    "dDurationMs": 2047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What inspired you to invent this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639507,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't people, it was..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1641373,
    "dDurationMs": 1974,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Drugs, drug, drug, drugs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643347,
    "dDurationMs": 1781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm experienced with drugs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645128,
    "dDurationMs": 2112,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1993, Mullis was awarded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647240,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both the Japan Prize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648620,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the Nobel Prize in\nchemistry for his invention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651950,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the polymerase chain reaction method."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654920,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although it wouldn't have\nexisted without his colleagues,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1657650,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mullis made PCR his\nstory and his story only."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663260,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were a lot of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664250,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who were like, he's such a fame hog."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666530,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, he completely didn't\ngive any of us credit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1669311,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I invented PCR."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670911,
    "dDurationMs": 1379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After I had invented PCR."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672290,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now it's like they\nbought into his version"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1674730,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675991,
    "dDurationMs": 1779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where he did this solo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1677770,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas there were a lot of people at Cetus Corp who helped him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681320,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As Erlich remarked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682887,
    "dDurationMs": 2895,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"To Kary, rewriting\nhistory was more important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685782,
    "dDurationMs": 1055,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than writing papers.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686837,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"He seems to have viewed PCR\nas a means to a celebrity.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1691368,
    "dDurationMs": 3692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He left Cetus and as far as I could tell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695060,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really stopped being a scientist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698510,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "... realized, I had in my hands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700550,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the thing that would make me famous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702380,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause I knew that night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703310,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was gonna get a Nobel Prize for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706589,
    "dDurationMs": 3981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He used his publicity to\nspringboard his eccentric views."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710570,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He talked about seeing glowing raccoons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1713390,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and being abducted by aliens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716120,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He would go around saying\nkind of crazy, shocking stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720320,
    "dDurationMs": 2856,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Distrust your fellow man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723176,
    "dDurationMs": 2874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're an arrogant little\nbunch of naked apes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726050,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wrote this book"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1727670,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called \"Dancing Naked in the Mind Field\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730970,
    "dDurationMs": 2454,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which the blurb on the book is amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733424,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's from the Washington\nPost, and it's like:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735347,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"The strangest guy to ever win\nthe Nobel Prize in chemistry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741440,
    "dDurationMs": 2749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He just would do like weird stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744189,
    "dDurationMs": 1361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you see me eating those leaves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747904,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was that a drug?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749298,
    "dDurationMs": 4292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was an expert witness\nin the OJ Simpson trial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753590,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He started a company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755210,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where he would PCR DNA from famous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760190,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dead celebrities like Marilyn Monroe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762740,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then he would make\nlike little trinkets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764600,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of them and sell them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1767597,
    "dDurationMs": 3723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not all of his\nideas were as harmless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771320,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't believe in global warming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773270,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't believe in the ozone hole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774950,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't believe that HIV caused AIDS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778790,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "HIV is not deadly. There's\nnot something called AIDS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1783380,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the early 2000s, HIV\ndenialism in South Africa"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786570,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was at a high,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788210,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while the country was battling\na crippling AIDS epidemic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791390,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we are facing is a catastrophe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1794450,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is indescribable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1796550,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "President Thabo Mbeki"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798080,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was under the influence\nof AIDS denialists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800780,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does HIV cause AIDS?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1803420,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does the virus cause\na syndrome? It can't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807660,
    "dDurationMs": 2035,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An even invited Nobel Prize winner,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809695,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kary Mullis, to weigh in on the issue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813290,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Under Mbeki's leadership,\nthe government refused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815600,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to provide adequate\ntreatment for those affected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1818321,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And more than 330,000 people died."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826136,
    "dDurationMs": 3774,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kary Mullis passed away in\nAugust, 2019 at the age of 74"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1829910,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to complications from pneumonia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1832160,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nonetheless, the legacy of PCR lives on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835100,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a year later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836240,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the method reached perhaps\nits most significant use yet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1839570,
    "dDurationMs": 2485,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as PCR COVID tests helped keep billions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842055,
    "dDurationMs": 2153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of people safe throughout the pandemic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845750,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes he's like, he's\nvery funny and charming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848690,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a good storyteller,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850010,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he's also, you feel\nlike he's a very sleazy guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1853520,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's like not a person\nyou'd want to be around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856160,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He did have a sort of, a sparky mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860810,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was not being forced by some company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1863510,
    "dDurationMs": 1449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to discover something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864959,
    "dDurationMs": 1075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was playing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866034,
    "dDurationMs": 1676,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like imaginative play."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867710,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was like, I have these snippets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869660,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what could I do with them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871520,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to me, he invented the solution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874490,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then like a huge field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878480,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of problems emerged to fit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881300,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But maybe the real takeaway\nfrom Mullis's story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884210,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is about automation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885950,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, he discovered PCR partly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1888110,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because his day-to-day job\nwas taken over by a machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1892310,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is a pretty important point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894620,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because all of us are maybe\nstaring down the barrel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897650,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a future where machines\ntake over our jobs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1900890,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially now with the surge\nof AI and generative models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904430,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's pretty scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906200,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it could also force\nus to come up with bigger,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909140,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more creative ideas, just\nlike it did for Kary Mullis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912830,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Automation might open our\nminds to breakthroughs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915230,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and discoveries that\ncould change the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919118,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924140,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, making breakthroughs like PCR"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926090,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take more than just opportunity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1927920,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You also need a mind\ntrained in problem solving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930440,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you're ready to seize the\nmoment when opportunity arises."
    } ]
  }, {
